   "front": "What should you know about the doorbell in \"an inspector calls\"?",
   "back": "The sharp ring cuts through the celebration. It's not just a sound - it's a dramatic interruption that changes everything. The doorbell symbolises the outside world intruding on the Birlings' comfortable existence.",
