   "id": "m2-modern-dramatic-techniques-fc3",
   "front": "What should you know about always write about effect on audience?",
   "back": "Identifying a dramatic technique earns minimal marks. Explaining its effect on the audience is where the marks are. Every time you mention lighting, sound, stage directions, or structure, you must answer: What does the audience see, hear, or feel? How does this shape their understanding of character or theme?",
   "tags": [
